g a model session, because only the former can fail � the SR-161 form applied to the partition instead of the perspective set. B-05 alone: the human ruling is an element the record must carry, not an observable the system states at the authority input, which is SR-139's and SR-140's ground.\", 'acceptance_criteria': \"A partition round writes the derivation record into the tracked component registry, never into session prose or a plan document alone; a live component row with no record, or a record omitting the candidate partitions, the declared objective, the constraints, any candidate's score, the selected partition or the human ruling, is reported naming the missing element; a selected partition the recorded scores do not rank first is reported unless the record carries the human override that chose it; the recorded ranking recomputes from the record's own objective, constraints and scores alone.\", 'priority': 'S', 'verification': 'Test', 'status': 'Approved', 'phase': 5, 'coincident': 'The need asks for a repeatable explanation of the component partition; the recorded candidates, objective, scores, selection and human ruling are that explanation, and a record missing any of them is reported.', 'aspect': 'process'}\r\ndocs/requirements/system-requirements.toml SR-186 Traceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 8, in <module>\r\n  File \"C:\\Users\\Peter\\AppData\\Local\\Programs\\Python\\Python311\\Lib\\encodings\\cp1252.py\", line 19, in encode\r\n    return codecs.charmap_encode(input,self.errors,encoding_table)[0]\r\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\r\nUnicodeEncodeError: 'charmap' codec can't encode character '\\u2192' in position 964: character maps to <undefined>\r\n","exit_code":1,"status":"failed"}}
